## 2. User Review & Key Decisions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Rule Evolution: Proposal Approval vs. Automatic Mutation**
> - **Recommended (Proposal & 1-Click Apply)**: When reviews indicate necessary rule adjustments (e.g., adding a stop-loss threshold or refining an entry condition), the AI Coach generates a **"Rule Evolution Proposal"**. The user reviews the before/after comparison and clicks `[Apply Evolution]` to promote the rule to the next version (`v1` → `v2`). This preserves user agency over their trading principles.
> - **Auto-Sync Option**: We also provide an optional toggle for statistical figures (win rate, expectancy, adherence count) to auto-update quietly in the background.

> [!TIP]
> **Hybrid Access: Modal Dialog ↔ Docked Side Drawer ↔ Dedicated Portfolio Tab**
> - **Anywhere in App**: A top header button `[📜 Rules (N)]` opens a centered **Modal Dialog** immediately. Clicking `[📌 Dock to Right]` pins it as a **450px Side Drawer** (similar to the AI ChatPanel), allowing continuous side-by-side monitoring while browsing financial data or entering orders.
> - **Within Portfolio**: A top-level sub-tab switcher `[ 💼 Portfolio & Holdings | 🎯 Investment Rules | 🧾 Journal & Ledger ]` allows opening the rules center full-screen without scrolling.

